{"id": "1535167056629076080", "channel_id": "1535167056629076080", "author_id": "1190911629819396141", "author_name": "zilulu01", "content": "回鍋將進一個月了，守密人等級卡在60，\n關卡推薦等級都在66左右，\n開始打的有些吃力，\n目前普通卡在星辰3-10，\n密契的功能還是不是很清楚，\n想問下當前的角色可以組成什麼陣容，\n命輪、密契該如何搭配呢?\n\n忘卻、星辰限定的角色該如何抽呢?\n看一下喚醒池，有些角色都沒出現，\n是不是只能等復刻了?", "timestamp": "2026-08-07T06:05:48.325000+00:00", "thread_id": "1535167056629076080", "attachments": [{"id": "1535167057061220442", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 581166, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535167056629076080/1535167057061220442/image.png?ex=6a76c73c&is=6a7575bc&hm=9ae74fe3be08366d8b9d846d608b3a89d2f3222654358793a16c33cf11a2cfae&"}, {"id": "1535167057476194376", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 532413, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535167056629076080/1535167057476194376/image.png?ex=6a76c73c&is=6a7575bc&hm=23f51bf5031f43893893fbfa8f4658557b569019db54a206bfa4d193afc1a4d3&"}, {"id": "1535167057891696722", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 241088, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535167056629076080/1535167057891696722/image.png?ex=6a76c73c&is=6a7575bc&hm=79efff04890945025acc3da5905f7b106b97c683871846501ffafef627192d62&"}, {"id": "1535167058239688804", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 773861, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535167056629076080/1535167058239688804/image.png?ex=6a76c73c&is=6a7575bc&hm=6205b267b7041d7e05024c10a00e3ac98546763214fb26a78568b0a312fa914a&"}, {"id": "1535167058675900506", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 651419, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1535167056629076080/1535167058675900506/image.png?ex=6a76c73c&is=6a7575bc&hm=b844779c515a7604f8ede850bd915c36a4e5fd811745a9aaaffcb046678cff51&"}, {"id": "1535167059288133713", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 538388, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp